				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.242
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>industrious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.26
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κὴ τέχνη</span> the art
